    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "îLESONIQ is where you allow electronic, dance and dubstep artists to make you move, groove, and feel, in the most idyllic, vibrant and colorful place. Let the energy of the crowd transport you to this parallel universe, located on an island in the heart of Parc Jean-Drapeau."
